#: hetu/server/watchdog.py:318
msgid ""
"❌ [看门狗] Sanic在Windows上的BUG, 它用Linux的Socket模型直接套用Windows，而Windows 共享 socket "
"上的操作协调由涉及的进程自己负责。已自动帮你自愈，生产环境请跑在Linux上"
msgstr ""
"❌ [Watchdog] Sanic bug on Windows: it directly applies the Linux socket "
"model to Windows, while coordination of operations on shared sockets on "
"Windows is handled by the processes involved. It has automatically self-"
"healed for you; please run on Linux in production"

#: hetu/server/watchdog.py:323
msgid ""
"❌ [看门狗] Sanic在Windows上的BUG, 它用Linux的Socket模型直接套用Windows，而Windows 共享 socket "
"上的操作协调由涉及的进程自己负责。自愈失败，此worker会一直无响应到有新连接被它抢到为止，请改用 WORKER_NUM: "
"1，生产环境请跑在Linux上"
msgstr ""
"❌ [Watchdog] Sanic bug on Windows: it directly applies the Linux socket "
"model to Windows, while coordination of operations on shared sockets on "
"Windows is handled by the processes involved. Self-healing failed; this "
"worker will remain unresponsive until it grabs a new connection. Please "
"switch to WORKER_NUM: 1, and run on Linux in production"

